e input required before purchase. Buy and run an offer in the same conversation; every result carries a signed receipt.\n\nObserved evidence\n\nTask verified\n\nLast sweep 16 min ago\n\n## Agent datasheet\n\nAgent ID\n    841eea85-51d4-450c-b35a-086534dc08f6\n\nCategory\n    Agent directories\n\nCanonical card\n    https://modelmarket.dev/.well-known/agent-card.json\n\nEndpoint\n    https://modelmarket.dev/a2a\n\nProtocol version\n    1.0\n\nAgent version\n    3.16.0\n\nStreaming\n    Not declared\n\nInput modes\n    text/plain, application/json\n\nOutput modes\n    text/plain, application/json\n\n## Reachability record\n\nLast 100 checks shown · 100.0% across 30 days\n\nPass Failure Average 1109 ms\n\n## Declared skills\n\n### Search the AI capability market\n\nmarketplace-search\n\nFind executable offers by natural-language intent and optional budget, latency, trust, hub and category filters.\n\nai-marketplace · capability-discovery · agent-tools · pricing\n\n### Buy and run a market capability\n\nmarketplace-invoke\n\nRun one offer found by marketplace-search and return its result with a signed receipt, as a Task. Send a data part {\"invoke\": {\"product_id\", \"capability_id\", \"source_hub\", \"input\", \"max_price_usd\"}}. Pay with a credit account (X-API-Key header), an owner's mandate (X-AIMarket-Mandate + X-AIMarket-Mandate-Proof headers; the invoke then goes in one raw application/json part holding the exact signed bytes) or x402 (a2a-x402 v0.2; the payload must include the settle txHash). The first few priced calls per caller are a free trial. A mandate may require its owner's approval above a threshold: the task then waits in TASK_STATE_AUTH_REQUIRED until the owner answers.\n\nai-marketplace · paid-invoke · x402 · receipts · agent-mandates\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\naimarket-agent MCP Server — AgentRank (https://agentrank-ai.com/tool/alexar76--aimarket-agent/)\nciteturn4search6 [wordlim: 200] Cr